        "passed": false,
        "score": 0.8,
        "rationale": "The agent correctly confirmed the window via stream_extent (2024-01-15 to 2024-01-19), retrieved per-sample co and co2 via history, computed the CO2/CO ratios accurately (42.0, 43.3, 38.6, 40.2, 41.9), flagged all samples as >10 (cellulose ageing), noted no missing co2, and gave a reasonable flat-trend assessment. However, the reported CO mean is wrong: the values 32, 30, 35, 33, 32 sum to 162, giving a mean of 32.4, not 32.0 (the CO2 mean of 1331.8 is correct). The agent should either compute s",
